Quick Start
cd ProjectWork/BskSim/core
python run_fault_simulator.py


Basic workflow:

Constellation tab: create clusters, choose formation, set spacing.

Fault tab: choose fault type(s), magnitudes, timing.

Fault Detection tab: load anomaly_detection_model.keras, set threshold.

DRL tab: load drl_task_reassignment.h5, choose strategy (Even / Capability / Load-Balanced).

Targets tab: add ground targets (optional).

Output tab: set duration; enable plots and Vizard export.

Run Simulation; view plots in Results tab, open .bin from Vizfile/_VizFiles/ in Vizard.

GUI Tabs (summary)

Constellation – clusters, formations, orbit params.

Target – target list, priorities, visibility analysis.

Fault – configure friction, power-limit, encoder, battery faults.

Fault Detection – autoencoder/Isolation Forest; XAI export.

Communication – link status and topology.

Task Reassignment – legacy DRL controls and summaries.

DRL – main PPO/DQN/TDHD model loading and live metrics.

Visualization – orbit lines, labels, cluster colours, export options.

Output – duration, logs, file destinations.

Results – plot browser, export tools.

Outputs

Logs: logs/sim_results_* – configuration, fault_log, telemetry CSV/JSON.
Plots: plots/ – attitude, RW, power, formation, detection, DRL.
Vizard: Vizfile/_VizFiles/*.bin – compressed playback (≈30 min → 30 s).

Troubleshooting

GUI won’t start: confirm tkinter is present; activate venv.

Basilisk import error: verify Basilisk install and PYTHONPATH.

No plots: ensure plots/ exists; set matplotlib backend to Agg in plots.py.

DRL model not loading: confirm core/drl_task_reassignment.h5 path; file permissions.

XAI missing: install shap and lime (optional).

No Vizard binary: enable “Save Binary” in Output tab; check Vizfile/_VizFiles/ write access.

Architecture (short)

Engine: spacecraft_simulation.py orchestrates Basilisk, faults, logging, plotting, and Vizard export.

GUI: spacecraft_simulator_gui.py with modular tabs in core/gui_tab/.

Faults: plugin modules in faults/ via fault_loader.py.

Detection: real_ml_fault_detection.py (autoencoder) and isolation_forest_fault_detection.py; XAI via satellite_xai.py.

DRL: drl_integration_bridge.py + drl_tab.py, using DRL/PPO.py (primary), DQNYear2.py, TDHDYear2.py.

Cluster: cluster_integration.py + formation_geometry.py.

Plots: plots.py + plotting/BSK_Plotting.py.

